doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Failure to complete action

  body
      p The deadline for "#{actionName}" has passed and you have not completed it. If you did complete it, please contact us — we may have made a mistake.

      p The Alliance counts on every member. We plan precise actions based on the number of people we expect to participate.

      p To learn more about our model, you can watch #[a(href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fR7Upo0DlYs&t=125s") this video].

      p Please know that if you miss several actions in a row, we will suspend your contract and no longer assign you tasks.
